{"id":"666617","name":"柿子汤圆","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/666617/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水磨糯米粉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟黑芝麻","amount":"40克"},{"name":"熟花生","amount":"20克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"20克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"40克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"熟花生打成粉。","img":"images/666617/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"熟黑芝麻打成粉。","img":"images/666617/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"全部做倒入碗中。","img":"images/666617/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入糖和猪油。","img":"images/666617/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666617/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搓成10克一个的小剂子。","img":"images/666617/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"全部做完，放入冰箱冷藏半小时。","img":"images/666617/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克糯米粉。","img":"images/666617/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入100克温水。","img":"images/666617/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/666617/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"克加入5克黄金芝士粉，50克加入面团加入1克抹茶粉。","img":"images/666617/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"得到一个橙黄色面团和一个绿色面团。","img":"images/666617/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取12克橙黄色面团，包入馅料。","img":"images/666617/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"团成圆形。","img":"images/666617/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"绿色面团擀成薄片，用模具压出柿子蒂。","img":"images/666617/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"柿子蒂。","img":"images/666617/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放在橙黄色汤圆上。","img":"images/666617/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"中心点压一下。","img":"images/666617/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"生胚就好了。","img":"images/666617/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"起锅烧水，水开后，下入汤圆，煮至浮起。","img":"images/666617/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/666617/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"来一个。","img":"images/666617/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/666617/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品图再来一张。","img":"images/666617/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}